      "outputs": [],
      "title": "minimax h3 two references",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "MCP image preset: minimax_h3_two_references\n\nSelect your own image in each LoadImage node. The supplied mug is a generated example. Change prompt and dimensions before running. Saved images go to the ComfyUI output folder. Seed is fixed for repeatable comparisons.\n\nH3 still adaptation: 20 steps, res_multistep/simple. Generates 5 frames and saves frame 0 as RGB. BasicGuider has no CFG or negative prompt. No audio VAE or custom speed nodes needed. ImageFromBatch selects the saved frame; set length=5 to save all five for comparison. Five-frame still quality and reference fidelity remain experimental.\n\nREF2VA edit: <Picture 1> is the source, <Picture 2> is the second reference when connected. Output follows the first image aspect ratio, rounded to 32px. Change megapixels on ImageScaleToTotalPixels to change output area (default 0.75MP). Original images still feed the reference encoder: ref_image_size=match is economical; max keeps more detail at higher cost. MCP undo and exact outside-mask preservation are not included in this standalone graph.\n\nPROMPT MASTER: Give your LLM minimax_h3_pseudo_image_master.txt (beside these presets) and your brief. It returns rewritten_prompt, wh_ratio and ratio_follow. Paste only the decoded rewritten_prompt into the H3 prompt field; apply size choices separately. The graph does not run the authoring LLM automatically. Keep still-image prose; no video/audio field wrapper is needed."
      ]
    }
